        "address": "11 W Jones St, Raleigh , NC 27601",
        "description": "<p>Pretend you&rsquo;ve been recruited as a member of the Culper Spy Ring, and you need to know how to decipher a message written in invisible ink. Supplies include a paint brush, water, drying cloth, vitriol (diluted sulfuric acid), Thomas Jefferson cipher and &ldquo;furnace box.&rdquo; Read the clues to find the coin with a hidden message, reveal the message using the brush and vitriol, then use the cipher to decode the message.</p>\n\n<p>Contact: Nancy Locquet Absillis,&nbsp;<a href=\"mailto:nancy.locquet@naturalsciences.org\">nancy.locquet@naturalsciences.org</a></p>\n",
